# ==========================================================
#           Looping
# ==========================================================
~ first_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]W-what just happened? Did I... go back to this morning? I need to fix all of this.
=> END

~ second_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")]No... Not again...
=> END

~ third_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")]Ugh... I'm never going to get used to this...
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Cook Phase
# ==========================================================
~ still_cooking
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Good morning, darling! I'm making breakfast. It'll be ready soon.
=> END

~ after_cooking
Elena:  [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Good morning, darling! Finally, you're awake. Come on, let's have breakfast.
=> END

~ finish_cooking
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Hey, darling! Breakfast is ready. Come eat with me!
=> END

~ still_inside_bedroom
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Darling? Are you awake?
Elena: I've been waiting for you. Breakfast is getting cold.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Eat Phase
# ==========================================================
~ done_eating
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Oh, by the way, Maya asked me to go out with her today.
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Oh? You two have plans?
Elena: Yeah. She said she wanted to hang out for a bit.
Adrian: Sounds nice. What time are you going?
Elena: Probably around 12 P.M. I shouldn't be out too late, though.
Adrian: Alright then. Have fun with her.
Elena: I will. 
=> END

~ not_eating
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]You're not eating, darling?
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]I'm not really hungry yet.
Elena: You should at least have something. I don't want you skipping breakfast.
Adrian: I'll eat in a bit. Don't worry.
Elena: Alright, but don't wait too long.
Elena: Oh, by the way, Maya asked me to go out with her today.
Adrian: Oh? You two have plans?
Elena: Yeah. She wanted to hang out for a bit.
Adrian: Sounds nice. What time are you going?
Elena: Probably around 12 P.M. I shouldn't be out too late, though.
Adrian: Alright then. Have fun with her.
Elena: I will.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Shower Phase
# ==========================================================
~ going_to_shower
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]I'm gonna take a shower. See you in a bit, darling.
=> END

~ caught_spying
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_angry")]Adrian?! What are you doing with my phone?
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Elena, wait. I can explain—
Elena: Were you reading my messages?!
Adrian: I was just trying to find something about Maya.
Elena: You could've asked me! You can't just go through my phone without my permission.
Adrian: I know, I'm sorry. But I had to make sure—
Elena: Make sure of what? You don't trust me now?
Adrian: It's not about trusting you. I'm trying to figure out what's happening.
Elena: About what? You should've asked me first. We've already talked about this, remember?
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Ready Phase
# ==========================================================
~ phone_call
Maya: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "maya")]Hey, Elena! Are you ready?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "elena_calm", true)]Almost. What's up?
Maya: I was thinking we could go out for lunch today. You and Adrian can come too.
Elena: Oh, sure! Let me ask him first.
Maya: Okay. I'll wait for you guys.
Elena: Where are we going?
Maya: It's a surprise. You'll see when you get here. 😉
Elena: Maya... you know I hate surprises.
Maya: I know. That's why I know you'll love this one.
Elena: Haha, okay. Give me a few minutes.
Maya: Take your time. See you soon!
=> END

~ phone_call_reject
Maya: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "maya")]Hey, Elena! Are you ready?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "elena_calm", true)]Actually... I don't think I can make it today.
Maya: Huh? Why not?
Elena: Something came up. Adrian and I are going to stay home today.
Maya: Oh... I see. Is everything okay?
Elena: Yeah, everything's fine. I just don't feel like going out today.
Maya: Are you sure? I was really looking forward to seeing you.
Elena: I'm sorry, Maya. Maybe some other time.
Maya: Okay. If that's what you want.
Elena: It is. I'll talk to you later, okay?
Maya: Yeah... later, Elena.
=> END

~ heading_out
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]I'm heading out now, love. See you later.
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")]Okay. Be careful.
Elena: I will. Love you.
Adrian: Love you too.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Items
# ==========================================================
~ doll
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.CENTER, "doll")]Hey, Elena. This plushie... Maya gave this to you, right?
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]Yeah. Why?
Adrian: I was just looking at it and... something feels weird.
Elena: Weird? What do you mean?
Adrian: There's something inside it.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_angry")]What?
Adrian: Wait... Is that a camera?
Elena: A camera?! Why would there be a camera inside my plushie?
Adrian: I don't know. But someone put it there.
Elena: ...Maya gave me this.
Adrian: I know. That's why I'm asking you... are you sure she didn't put this here?
=> END

~ present
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.CENTER, "gift")]Elena, I found something in the closet.
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")]What?
Adrian: This gift... it's for me, isn't it?
Elena: ...Yeah.
Adrian: You were going to surprise me?
Elena: I was.
Adrian: I'm sorry. I didn't mean to find it.
Elena: It's fine.
Adrian: Elena...
Elena: No, it's okay. I just... need some air.
Adrian: Where are you going?
Elena: I don't know. Just... somewhere.
Adrian: Elena, wait—
Elena: I'll be back later.
Adrian: ...
Elena: I just need some time alone.
=> END
